 t years. The band offers a wealth of experience and a vast knowledge of po
 pular music genres. Wear the Fox Hat boasts some great vocal harmonies\, a
 ccompanied by strong instrumental backing. Mixed with exceptional vocals a
 nd quality reproductions of songs from some of the best acts in popular mu
 sic history – you’re in for a thoroughly enjoyable experience from the
  first song to last resounding note.
